<title>ESTONIA: CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS JUNE 4/5.</title>
<headline>CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS JUNE 4/5.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Estonian central bank</p>
<p>released the following fixings for the Estonian kroon for June</p>
<p>4/5. The Estonian kroon is pegged at eight kroons to a German</p>
<p>mark.</p>
<p>	   June 4/5	  June 3/4</p>
<p> CZK	0.42153	  0.41718</p>
<p> DKK	2.10131	  2.09984</p>
<p> FIM	2.67312	  2.66412</p>
<p> HUF	0.07508	  0.07491</p>
<p> JPY	0.11919	  0.11909</p>
<p> LTL	3.46657	  3.45515</p>
<p> LVL     24.22781	 24.15734</p>
<p> RUR	0.0024	   0.00239</p>
<p> SEK	1.78501	  1.77349</p>
<p> UAH	7.46856	  7.43843</p>
<p> USD     13.868	   13.818</p>
<p> XEU     15.623	   15.61089</p>
<p>For a full listing see Bank of Estonia </p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom, +372 620 9202/1 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
